{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Actions"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/actions"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"heading","text":"Buttons","level":3,"anchor":"Buttons"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","type":"reference"},{"text":" proposes layout with text only, icon only or text and icon.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Four hierarchies are proposed for all layouts: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"strong","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"minimal","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"negative","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Two style are available: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"loading","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If button is placed on colored surface using ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrom.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A button with ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Negative","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Two sizes are available: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    OUDSButton(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative, size: .small) {}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For accessibility reasons, if the user in the system settings toggles the option to reduce the animations, the loading indicator will be frozen to be more comfortable for the user.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the user toggles the low power mode, the loading indicator will be frozen to prevent the CPU to work and waste energy.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"actions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"meta